        "steam_appid": 4010780,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/extras/7ab7a97054ff244dbfa26b22b7a274c6.avif?t=1763900857\" width=1117 height=217 /></span>OLYEN is a first-person puzzle and exploration game set in a forgotten valley once inhabited by four sages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across ruins, mechanisms, and impossible structures, you’ll uncover their scattered writings notes, diaries, and reports that piece together a non-linear story of knowledge, ambition, and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in OLYEN is part of a larger mechanism. As you explore, you’ll observe how each element connects to the whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to evoke curiosity and calm, OLYEN invites you to slow down, look closely, and experience the quiet satisfaction of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey lasts around three hours, offering a compact yet atmospheric experience focused on observation, logic, and the joy of finding meaning in a forgotten world.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/extras/7ab7a97054ff244dbfa26b22b7a274c6.avif?t=1763900857\" width=1117 height=217 /></span>OLYEN is a first-person puzzle and exploration game set in a forgotten valley once inhabited by four sages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across ruins, mechanisms, and impossible structures, you’ll uncover their scattered writings notes, diaries, and reports that piece together a non-linear story of knowledge, ambition, and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in OLYEN is part of a larger mechanism. As you explore, you’ll observe how each element connects to the whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to evoke curiosity and calm, OLYEN invites you to slow down, look closely, and experience the quiet satisfaction of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey lasts around three hours, offering a compact yet atmospheric experience focused on observation, logic, and the joy of finding meaning in a forgotten world.</p>",
        "short_description": "Explore a forgotten valley filled with ancient mechanisms and mysteries. Solve intricate 3D puzzles and uncover the story of the four sages who once lived there.",
